WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:06.700
~Subtitle by Joshua Romel Ladrera~

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.440
This is the story of the day my life ended.

3
00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:15.690
Eugene..

4
00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:16.840
I'm kidding!

5
00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:18.610
It was the happiest day of my life.

6
00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:19.850
Our wedding day.

7
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.740
The biggest shindig
to hit the kingdom in forever.

8
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.640
Everyone dying to
catch a glimpse of me.. Us,

9
00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:27.350
I meant us.

10
00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:29.000
Everything was perfect

11
00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:31.660
just like I always dream it would be.

12
00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:32.230
Yeah,

13
00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:33.680
everything was perfect

14
00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:34.800
Oh, come on!

15
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.660
They still can't get my nose right.

16
00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:38.870
It was a magical day.

17
00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:41.790
And everything went just as we plan.

18
00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:43.510
Well...

19
00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:44.800
Almost.

20
00:01:31.330 --> 00:01:32.540
Dearly beloved..

21
00:01:32.890 --> 00:01:34.490
We are gathered here today

22
00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:39.220
to celebrate the joining of
Rapunzel and Eugene in marriage.

23
00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:44.420
..live their life together as husband and wife.

24
00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:46.700
in everlasting peace.

25
00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:49.590
May I have the rings?

26
00:01:51.550 --> 00:01:56.000
Those were my grandmother's wedding ring.
The kingdom is lost!

27
00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:11.110
had their loops in the love and friendship.
And those you have given.

28
00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:36.690
Frying pan. Frying pan, here..

29
00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:45.170
That's the signal. Release the ducks.

30
00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:47.890
That's the ducks, release the lanterns.

31
00:05:12.280 --> 00:05:14.280
..in everlasting peace.

32
00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:17.000
May I have the rings?

33
00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:36.630
I.. I now pronounce you
husband and wife.

34
00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:37.970
You may kiss.

35
00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:45.610
Happy Birthday!

36
00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:56.540
So, who want a piece of cake?

37
00:06:01.530 --> 00:06:04.620
~Subtitle by Joshua Romel Ladrera~
